---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Cookie policy"
  description="How the Data Decision Consulting website currently uses cookies, browser storage and analytics."
  path="/cookies/"
  updated="24 Aug 2026"
>
  <h2>Current position</h2>
  <p>
    The website currently uses no third-party analytics, advertising pixels, session-replay tools or
    other non-essential cookie technology. The contact form can capture campaign parameters without
    storing them in a browser cookie.
  </p>

  <h2>Essential browser storage</h2>
  <p>
    The website does not intentionally create essential cookies. Hosting infrastructure may process
    ordinary request metadata needed to deliver and protect the site.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics events</h2>
  <p>
    The interface can record actions such as opening an FAQ or starting the enquiry form. These
    events remain in the page and are not sent to an analytics service.
  </p>

  <h2>Future changes</h2>
  <p>
    If Data Decision Consulting adds non-essential cookies or third-party analytics, this policy and
    the consent controls will be updated before that technology is enabled.
  </p>

  <h2>Your control</h2>
  <p>
    There is no cookie banner because the current website uses no non-essential cookies. If that
    changes, the site will present the controls needed for a meaningful choice.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
